# RESETIUS | ADH156_o3 { ; Anthony Hanmer 2000
# RESETIUS |   Angle 36 ; Cesaro variation alphabet:  o (3)
# RESETIUS |   Axiom d\40d\40d\40d\40d\40d\40d\40d\40d/180d/40d/40d/40d/40d/40d/40d/40d/40d/40d
# RESETIUS |   d=d\80d/160d\80d
